  m_Name: S04_Equip_HiVis_Vest
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Valari.Data.TutorialData
  <Title>k__BackingField: Equip Your High-Visibility Vest
  <Description>k__BackingField: The high-vis vest hangs below the hard hat on the
    PPE station. Pick it up and equip it the same way. High-visibility clothing is
    rated by class, Class 2 vests (fluorescent yellow or orange with reflective strips)
    are the minimum standard in most warehouse environments. The reflective strips
    are critical in poorly lit zones and allow forklift operators to see you from
    up to 100 metres away. Once both items are equipped, you are cleared to enter
    the operational floor.
  <VoiceOver>k__BackingField: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fd0668cebeb20374780d285b343be799, type: 3}
  <HasChallenges>k__BackingField: 1
